{"id":902,"date":"2025-05-13T14:29:04","date_gmt":"2025-05-13T12:29:04","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/a-journey-to-the-past-the-archaeological-sites-of-menorca\/"},"modified":"2026-09-23T23:21:38","modified_gmt":"2026-09-23T21:21:38","slug":"talayotic-tour-of-menorca","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/en\/talayotic-tour-of-menorca\/","title":{"rendered":"A Journey to the past: the Archaeological Sites of Menorca"},"content":{"rendered":"<article>\n<header>\n<p>Discover Menorca&#8217;s most iconic prehistoric monuments\u2014navetas, talayots, and taula enclosures\u2014with an engaging and informative guided tour led by <strong>Daniel Vaquera<\/strong>, an official local guide. Ideal for history buffs, curious families, and travelers who want to understand the soul of the island. <\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/en\/field-trips\/\">See all excursions \u00bb<\/a><\/p>\n<\/header>\n<nav aria-label=\"\u00cdndice\">\n<strong>Content<\/strong><\/p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"#menorca-talayotica\">What is Talayotic Menorca (UNESCO)?<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"#itinerarios\">Suggested itineraries (\u00bd day and full day)<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"#sitios\">Key tour sites<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"#practico\">Practical information<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"#incluye\">What&#8217;s included \/ not included<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"#faq\">Frequently Asked Questions<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"#reserva\">Booking and contact<\/a><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<\/nav>\n<section id=\"menorca-talayotica\">\n<h2>What is Talayotic Menorca (UNESCO)?<\/h2>\n<p><strong>Talayotic Menorca<\/strong> was inscribed on the World Heritage List in 2023 for its cyclopean architecture and its exceptional testimony to prehistoric life in the Mediterranean. The site encompasses dozens of sites integrated into traditional agricultural landscapes.  If you want the full context\u2014chronology, monument types, and how to visit respectfully\u2014check out our <a href=\"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/en\/menorca-talayotica-guia\/\">complete guide to Talayotic Menorca<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p>If you like combining archaeology and landscape, I also recommend reading our <a href=\"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/en\/guia-faros-menorca\/\">lighthouse guide<\/a> and the <a href=\"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/en\/las-mejores-playas-de-menorca-y-cuales-evitar-en-temporada-alta\/\">best beaches<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/section>\n<section id=\"itinerarios\">\n<h2>Suggested itineraries<\/h2>\n<h3>\u00bd day option (3.5\u20134 h)<\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Naveta des Tudons<\/strong> \u2013 emblematic collective tomb and must-have photo.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Torralba d&#8217;en Salort<\/strong> \u2013 spectacular <em>taula<\/em> enclosure and domestic structures.<\/li>\n<li>Interpretation of the Menorcan <strong>rural landscape<\/strong> between stops.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3>Full day option (6\u20137 h)<\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Includes the \u00bd day option + <strong>Torre d&#8217;en Galm\u00e9s<\/strong>, the most extensive Talayotic settlement.<\/li>\n<li>Lunch break (local recommendations from our <a href=\"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/en\/restaurantes-menorca-2026\/\">restaurant guide<\/a>) and, if it fits, <strong>sunset<\/strong>.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/section>\n<section id=\"sitios\">\n<h2>Key tour sites<\/h2>\n<article>\n<h3>Naveta des Tudons (Ciutadella)<\/h3>\n<p>Funerary monument with a horseshoe plan and two superimposed chambers, unique in the world. It is Menorca\u2019s archaeological icon and a quick and photogenic stop. <\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Visit<\/strong>: 20\u201330 min<\/li>\n<li><strong>Access<\/strong>: short and signposted path from the parking lot<\/li>\n<li><strong>Tip<\/strong>: first or last hour for soft light and fewer people<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/article>\n<article>\n<h3>Torralba d&#8217;en Salort (Alaior)<\/h3>\n<p>Complex with <strong>talayots<\/strong>, hypostyle hall and one of the most impressive <strong>taulas<\/strong> on the island. In season, it organizes special activities at sunset or at night. <\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Visit<\/strong>: 45\u201360 min<\/li>\n<li><strong>Best<\/strong>: the monumental taula and the open landscape<\/li>\n<li><strong>Extra<\/strong>: <em>Sunset<\/em> \/ <em>Starlight<\/em> program depending on dates<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/article>\n<article>\n<h3>Torre d&#8217;en Galm\u00e9s (Alaior)<\/h3>\n<p>The largest Talayotic settlement in Menorca, on a strategic hill with views and an interpretation center. It features water collection systems and circular dwellings. <\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Visit<\/strong>: 60\u201390 min<\/li>\n<li><strong>Services<\/strong>: picnic area, accessible sections<\/li>\n<li><strong>Tip<\/strong>: hat and water in summer; ideal with a light breeze<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/article>\n<\/section>\n<section id=\"practico\">\n<h2>Practical information<\/h2>\n<h3>Best time<\/h3>\n<p>All year round. In summer, first\/last hours; in winter, avoid days of extreme wind and mud after rains. <\/p>\n<h3>What to bring<\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Closed shoes with gripping soles<\/li>\n<li>Water (1\u20131.5 L per person) and some food<\/li>\n<li>Sun protection or windbreaker depending on the season<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3>Accessibility<\/h3>\n<p>Uneven terrain overall. <em>Torre d&#8217;en Galm\u00e9s<\/em> offers accessible sections and picnic tables. We adapt the pace and stops for your comfort. <\/p>\n<h3>Rules<\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Do not climb on walls or touch structures<\/li>\n<li>Drones\/tripods: only with permission<\/li>\n<li>Respect signage and private properties<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<details>\n<summary>Tickets and schedules<\/summary>\n<p>Vary according to season and site management. We recommend checking before coming: <\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/menorcatalayotica.info\/contingut.aspx?idioma=2&#038;idpub=10664\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Naveta des Tudons \u2014 official info<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.torralbadensalort.com\/en\/home\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Torralba d&#8217;en Salort \u2014 official site<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.menorca.es\/Contingut.aspx?IDIOMA=3&#038;IdPub=8446\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Torre d&#8217;en Galm\u00e9s \u2014 Consell<\/a><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/details>\n<\/section>\n<section id=\"incluye\">\n<h2>What&#8217;s included \/ not included<\/h2>\n<h3>Includes<\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Official local guide (ES \/ EN \/ FR \/ IT)<\/li>\n<li>Tailor-made itinerary according to interests and time<\/li>\n<li>Recommendations for eating and continuing to explore<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3>Not included<\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Entrance fees to sites<\/li>\n<li>Transportation (possible to add transfer upon request)<\/li>\n<li>Meals and extras<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/section>\n<section id=\"faq\">\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions<\/h2>\n<details>\n<summary>Is it suitable for children?<\/summary>\n<p>Yes. We adjust the pace and explanations; closed shoes and water are essential. <\/p>\n<\/details>\n<details>\n<summary>Are there accessible sections?<\/summary>\n<p>At Torre d&#8217;en Galm\u00e9s there are accessible areas; overall, the route has uneven ground. We\u2019ll advise you based on your situation. <\/p>\n<\/details>\n<details>\n<summary>What happens if it rains or is very windy?<\/summary>\n<p>We reschedule the route\/times to guarantee your safety and the best experience.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<details>\n<summary>Can we add a special activity (sunset, night)?<\/summary>\n<p>Yes, subject to programming and site availability.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/section>\n<section id=\"reserva\">\n<h2>Booking and contact<\/h2>\n<p>Tell me dates, language and if you prefer \u00bd day or full day. I will design your tailor-made Talayotic visit. <\/p>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/en\/contacto\/\"><strong>Check availability<\/strong><\/a> \u00b7 <a href=\"https:\/\/api.whatsapp.com\/send?phone=34649902301&#038;text=Hola%2C%20quiero%20informaci%C3%B3n%20del%20tour%20talay%C3%B3tico%20(1%2F2%20d%C3%ADa%20o%20d%C3%ADa%20completo)%20para%20%5Bn.%20de%20personas%5D%20y%20%5Bfechas%5D\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Direct WhatsApp<\/strong><\/a>\n<\/p>\n<p>Do you like history and landscapes? Also check out our <a href=\"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/en\/field-trips\/\">guided tours<\/a>, the <a href=\"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/en\/guia-faros-menorca\/\">lighthouse guide<\/a>, and <a href=\"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/en\/rutas-de-senderismo-para-conectar-con-la-naturaleza-menorquina\/\">hiking routes<\/a>. <\/p>\n<h2>More Menorca guides<\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/en\/menorca-talayotica-guia\/\">Talayotic Menorca: the complete guide \u2192<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/en\/what-to-see-in-ciutadella-menorca\/\">What to see in Ciutadella \u2192<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/en\/visita-guiada-mahon-menorca\/\">Discover Ma\u00f3 \u2192<\/a><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/section>\n<\/article>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\",\n  \"@graph\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"BlogPosting\",\n      \"mainEntityOfPage\": { \"@type\": \"WebPage\", \"@id\": \"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/tour-talayotico-menorca\/\" },\n      \"headline\": \"Tour talay\u00f3tico en Menorca: Naveta des Tudons, Torralba d'en Salort y Torre d'en Galm\u00e9s\",\n      \"description\": \"Visita guiada por los monumentos prehist\u00f3ricos m\u00e1s ic\u00f3nicos de Menorca: navetas, talayots y taulas, con gu\u00eda oficial local. Rutas de \u00bd d\u00eda o d\u00eda completo.\",\n      \"author\": { \"@type\": \"Person\", \"name\": \"Daniel Vaquera\", \"jobTitle\": \"Gu\u00eda oficial de turismo de Menorca\", \"worksFor\": { \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Voyager Menorca\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/\" } },\n      \"publisher\": { \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Voyager Menorca\", \"logo\": { \"@type\": \"ImageOb